{# `App\MessageHandler\SendEmailMessageHandler` renders this file the same
   three-block way verify_email.html.twig documents. Sent to the parent
   (via `NotificationAddressResolver::forPlayer($childUser)`) whenever
   `ChildTrainerService::recordBlockedClick()` decides to (re-)notify
   (AC-16, D3b's 24h throttle). Context: `childName`, `trainerName`,
   `reviewUrl` (the "Review Registration" link, `app_family_request_review`,
   shipped by `Family\ChildTrainerRequestController::review()`). #}
{% if false %}
    {% block subject %}{{ childName }} clicked {{ trainerName }}'s registration link{% endblock %}
    {% block text %}
Hello,

{{ childName }} just tried to register with {{ trainerName }} using a
trainer's invitation link, but child accounts cannot connect themselves to a
trainer directly.

Review and complete this registration: {{ reviewUrl }}

If you don't recognize this, no connection has been made and none will be
made until you act.
    {% endblock %}
{% endif %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <title>{{ block('subject') }}</title>
    </head>
    <body>
        <p>Hello,</p>
        <p>{{ childName }} just tried to register with {{ trainerName }} using a trainer's invitation link, but child accounts cannot connect themselves to a trainer directly.</p>
        <p><a href="{{ reviewUrl }}">Review Registration</a></p>
        <p>If you don't recognize this, no connection has been made and none will be made until you act.</p>
    </body>
</html>
